cat > diagnosis.json << 'EOF'
{"spec_element": "invariant", "proof_obligation": "preservation", "diagnosis": "The loop invariant on line 10 uses (|res|) - 1 as the upper bound for j, which should be |res|. This means the invariant does not constrain pairs involving the last element of res. When a new element is appended, the preservation obligation fails because the invariant cannot guarantee the new element differs from all previous ones. Additionally, the bridge from invariant+loop-exit to postcondition fails because the postcondition requires 0 <= i < j < |result| but the invariant only provides 0 <= i < j < |result| - 1."}
EOF

